#. ~ Description of variant "cream pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of milky, off-white pants dyed a shade of soft cream.  They're "
"slightly warmer than jeans."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "gray pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A business-like set of stone-gray trousers for business-like people, these "
"pants are the same hue as concrete and are relatively warm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
